{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01663","headline":"杂曲歌辞 结客少年场行 · 虞世南","name":"杂曲歌辞 结客少年场行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韩魏多奇节，倜傥遗名利。\n共矜然诺心，各负纵横志。\n结友一言重，相思千里至。\n绿沈明月弦，金络浮云辔。\n吹箫入吴市，击筑游燕肆。\n寻源博望侯，结客远相求。\n少年重一顾，长驱背陇头。\n焰焰霜戈动，耿耿劒虹浮。\n天山冬夏雪，交河南北流。\n云起龙沙暗，木落鴈行秋。\n轻生徇知己，非是爲身谋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}